# Wave T38 (Driftlog kit): pontoon (prop) — a GROWING PONTOON: a bundle of horizontal logs lashed with rope, one X-lashed upright post, log-end grain at the east face, floating on the sea at Driftlog's west edge — the town still adding logs, three generations on (CORALIE's dialogue). Four float off the west rim. Fully opaque, sea water baked in. (WAVE-T38-DRIFTLOG-PLAN.md §3.7/§5.)
